<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia March consumer prices up 32 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zambia March consumer prices up 32 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's all-items consumer price index rose by 0.8 percent in March, bringing the year-on-year increase to 32.0 percent, the central bank said.</p>
<p>			 Mar 1997	  Feb 1997	  Mar 1996</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct change   32.0		34.7		42.7</p>
<p>All-items index    237.5	     235.5	     180.0</p>
<p>Note - Index 1985 = 100</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom: +260 1 222-689</p>
</text>
